<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Know Your Presence - Business Pulse Score</title>

<!-- ============ GOOGLE ANALYTICS (GA4) ============ -->
<!-- Replace G-XXXXXXXXXX below with your real Measurement ID from analytics.google.com -->
<!-- NOTE: This will NOT track on the claude.ai preview link due to that platform's security
     policy blocking scripts from Google's servers - it WILL work once deployed on your own
     real domain (Render, Railway, your own hosting, etc.) -->
<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-XXXXXXXXXX"></script>
<script>
  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
  gtag('js', new Date());
  gtag('config', 'G-XXXXXXXXXX');
</script>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --green: #0f9d58;
  --green-dark: #0c8248;
  --amber: #e8a33d;
  --red: #d64545;
  --ink: #0d1321;
  --paper: #ffffff;
  --bg: #f7f8fa;
  --muted: #5b6472;
  --border: #e6e8ec;
  --accent-tint: #eaf6ef;
  --font-head: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
  --font-body: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 190px; }
html, body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--paper);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}
h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: var(--font-head); margin: 0; }
p { line-height: 1.6; }
a { text-decoration: none; }
[hidden] { display: none !important; }
.section-inner { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

/* ============ NAV ============ */
.nav { background: var(--ink); position: relative; z-index: 5; }
.nav-inner {
  max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 14px 24px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.nav-brand { color: white; font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.15rem; }
.nav-controls { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.control-select {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: white;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); padding: 7px 10px;
  border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.82rem; cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-body);
}
.control-select option { color: var(--ink); }
.nav-cta {
  background: var(--green); color: white; padding: 9px 16px;
  border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem;
}
.nav-cta:hover { background: var(--green-dark); }

/* ============ HERO ============ */
.hero { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0d1321 0%, #16203a 100%); color: white; padding: 72px 0 64px; }
.hero-inner { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; text-align: center; }
.hero-eyebrow { color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 0.78rem; margin: 0 0 16px; }
.hero-headline { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 18px; }
.hero-sub { font-size: 1.08rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto 30px; }
.hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.btn-primary {
  background: var(--green); color: white; padding: 15px 30px;
  border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; display: inline-block;
}
.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--green-dark); }
.hero-price { font-size: 0.95rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); }
.hero-price strong { color: white; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-left: 6px; font-family: var(--font-head); }
.scan-counter { color: var(--green-light, #12b368); font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.hero-trust {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: white; font-family: var(--font-head);
  letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-top: 14px; padding: 12px 24px;
  background: var(--green); border-radius: 999px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(15,157,88,0.4);
  flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; row-gap: 0;
}
.big-o {
  font-size: 2.5em;
  line-height: 0.6;
  display: inline-block;
  vertical-align: middle;
}

/* ============ PAS SECTIONS ============ */
.pas-section { padding: 64px 0; }
.pas-section h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); text-align: center; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.pas-lead { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 40px; font-size: 1.02rem; }

.problem { background: var(--paper); }
.stat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px; }
.stat-card { text-align: center; padding: 24px; background: var(--bg); border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border); }
.stat-number { display: block; font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--green); margin-bottom: 8px; }
.stat-label { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }

.agitate { background: var(--ink); color: white; }
.agitate h2 { color: white; }
.agitate-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.agitate-item { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 22px; border-radius: 14px; }
.agitate-icon { font-size: 1.6rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.agitate-item p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82); font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0; }

.solution { background: var(--paper); }
.feature-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.feature-card { padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--bg); }
.feature-icon { font-size: 1.7rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.feature-card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.feature-card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; }

.how { background: var(--accent-tint); }
.steps-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 22px; }
.step-item { text-align: center; }
.step-num {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--green);
  color: white; font-weight: 700; font-family: var(--font-head); margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.step-item h4 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.step-item p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin: 0; }

.pricing { background: var(--paper); }
.pricing-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.pricing-card { text-align: center; padding: 28px 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; }
.pricing-card.featured { border-color: var(--green); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(15,157,88,0.12); }
.pricing-card h4 { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 10px; font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 600; }
.pricing-amount { font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 10px; }
.pricing-note { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }

.final-cta { background: var(--ink); color: white; padding: 70px 0; text-align: center; }
.final-cta h2 { color: white; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.final-cta p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin-bottom: 26px; }

.footer { background: var(--ink); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); padding: 22px 0; font-size: 0.82rem; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
.footer-links { margin-top: 8px; }
.footer-links a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); text-decoration: none; }
.footer-links a:hover { color: white; text-decoration: underline; }

/* ============ SCAN TOOL ============ */
.scan-section { background: var(--bg); padding: 64px 0; }
.input-card, .results {
  background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(13,19,33,0.04), 0 8px 24px rgba(13,19,33,0.04);
  margin-bottom: 24px; max-width: 760px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;
}
.input-card h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 4px 0 0; }
.sample-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 16px 0 20px; }
.sample-btn {
  background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--ink);
  padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.85rem; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 500;
}
.sample-btn:hover { border-color: var(--green); color: var(--green); }
form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; gap: 6px; text-align: left; }
input {
  padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px;
  font-size: 1rem; font-family: var(--font-body);
}
input:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--green); outline-offset: 1px; }
.place-confirmed { color: var(--green); font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; margin: -8px 0 4px; }
.scan-email-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.78rem; margin: -8px 0 6px; }
.scan-error { background: #fdeeee; color: #b23b3b; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
button.primary {
  background: var(--green); color: white; border: none; padding: 13px 22px;
  border-radius: 10px; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;
  margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-body);
}
button.primary:hover { background: var(--green-dark); }
.rescan {
  background: transparent; color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 11px 20px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem; cursor: pointer;
  margin-top: 22px; font-weight: 600;
}

.score-hero { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 30px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.gauge {
  width: 140px; height: 140px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: conic-gradient(var(--green) 0deg, var(--border) 0deg);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative;
  flex-shrink: 0; transition: background 0.4s ease;
}
.gauge::before { content: ""; position: absolute; width: 108px; height: 108px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--paper); }
#scoreNumber { position: relative; font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; }
.score-meta h2 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 1.5rem; text-align: left; }
.grade { margin: 0; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); }
.potential { color: var(--ink); margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
.potential strong { color: var(--green); font-size: 1.1rem; }

.breakdown { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-top: 32px; }
.breakdown-item { background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; }
.breakdown-item .label { font-weight: 700; text-transform: capitalize; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
.bar-bg { background: var(--border); border-radius: 6px; height: 7px; overflow: hidden; }
.bar-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 6px; width: 0; transition: width 0.9s ease; }
.score-tag { text-align: right; font-size: 0.78rem; margin-top: 6px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }

.action-plan { margin-top: 36px; }
.action-plan h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.action-plan .sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin: 0 0 16px; }
.plan-columns { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
.plan-col { background: var(--accent-tint); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; }
.plan-col h4 { font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0c6b3d; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.plan-col ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; }
.plan-col li { margin-bottom: 9px; }

.cta-row {
  margin-top: 30px; display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between; background: var(--ink); color: white; padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 14px;
}
.cta-row p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; max-width: 400px; }

.checkout-overlay {
  position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(13,19,33,0.6); z-index: 100;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px;
}
.checkout-modal {
  background: white; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; max-width: 380px; width: 100%;
  position: relative; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}
.checkout-close {
  position: absolute; top: 14px; right: 16px; background: none; border: none;
  font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; line-height: 1;
}
.checkout-modal h3 { font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0 0 6px; }
.checkout-sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin: 0 0 18px; }
.checkout-label { display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.checkout-optional { font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.78rem; }
.checkout-label input, .checkout-label select {
  width: 100%; margin-top: 6px; padding: 11px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.95rem; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: var(--font-body); background: white;
}
.checkout-error { background: #fdeeee; color: #b23b3b; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.82rem; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.checkout-pay-btn { width: 100%; text-align: center; display: block; }
.checkout-note { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.76rem; margin: 12px 0 0; }

.cta-btn {
  background: var(--green); color: white; border: none; padding: 12px 20px;
  border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-family: var(--font-body); white-space: nowrap;
}

@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .score-hero { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; }
}

/* ============ AI SEARCH VISIBILITY ============ */
.ai-search { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f7f8fa 0%, #eaf6ef 100%); }
.ai-platform-row { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 24px 0; }
.ai-chip { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; }
.ai-visibility-card {
  max-width: 560px; margin: 24px auto 0; background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; text-align: center;
}
.ai-vis-number { display: block; font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 4px; }
.ai-vis-label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); }
.ai-vis-note { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--muted); }

/* ============ FREE TOOLS ============ */
.free-tools { background: var(--paper); }
.tools-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.tool-card { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px; background: var(--bg); position: relative; }
.tool-card.active-tool { background: var(--accent-tint); border-color: var(--green); }
.tool-badge {
  position: absolute; top: -10px; right: 16px; background: var(--green); color: white;
  font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px;
}
.tool-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 8px; font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 700; }
.tool-card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin: 0 0 14px; }
.tool-widget { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.tool-widget-stack { flex-direction: column; }
.tool-widget input, .tool-widget select {
  flex: 1; min-width: 200px; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-family: var(--font-body); background: white;
}
.tool-widget-stack input, .tool-widget-stack select { min-width: 100%; }
.tool-widget button {
  background: var(--green); color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 18px;
  border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.9rem;
}
.tool-result { margin-top: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; background: white; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.88rem; word-break: break-all; }
.tool-result a { color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; }
.tool-result-multi { text-align: left; }
.tool-result-multi .result-block { margin-bottom: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.tool-result-multi .result-block:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; border-bottom: none; }
.tool-result-multi .result-label { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--green); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.03em; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.tool-result-multi .result-text { white-space: pre-wrap; }
.copy-btn { background: var(--ink); color: white; border: none; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.72rem; cursor: pointer; margin-left: 8px; }
#qrCanvasWrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 10px; }
#qrDownloadLink { display: block; text-align: center; }
.hashtag-pill { display: inline-block; background: var(--accent-tint); color: var(--ink); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.82rem; margin: 3px; }
.tool-cta { display: block; margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--green); text-decoration: none; }
.tool-cta:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

/* ============ AUDIENCE ============ */
.audience { background: var(--accent-tint); }
.audience-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.audience-card { background: white; border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; }
.audience-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 10px; font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 700; }
.audience-card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin: 0; }

/* ============ TESTIMONIALS ============ */
.testimonials { background: var(--paper); }
.illustrative-note { font-style: italic; font-size: 0.82rem; }
.testimonial-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.testimonial-card { background: var(--bg); border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px; border: 1px solid var(--border); }
.testimonial-card p { font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 12px; font-style: italic; }
.testimonial-card span { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }

</style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ============ NAV ============ -->
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <span class="nav-brand" data-i18n="brand">Know Your Presence</span>
      <div class="nav-controls">
        <a href="#scanTool" class="nav-cta" data-i18n="navCta">Free Scan</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <p class="hero-eyebrow" data-i18n="heroEyebrow">FOR BUSINESS OWNERS WHO HATE GUESSING</p>
      <h1 class="hero-headline" data-i18n="heroHeadline">Your customers already judged your business online. You just haven't seen what they saw.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub" data-i18n="heroSub">One scan reveals your Google presence, social media health, website performance, and reputation — scored, benchmarked, and turned into a 90-day fix-it plan.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#scanTool" class="btn-primary" data-i18n="heroCta">Run My Free Scan</a>
        <div class="hero-price">
          <span data-i18n="heroPriceLabel">Full report + 8 free tools from</span>
          <strong id="heroPriceTag">₹899</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p id="scanCounter" class="scan-counter" hidden></p>
        <p class="hero-trust" data-i18n="heroTrust">🔒 <span class="big-o">O</span>ne diagnosis. <span class="big-o">O</span>ne plan. <span class="big-o">O</span>ne price. No subscription, ever.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ============ PROBLEM (P) ============ -->
  <section class="pas-section problem">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2 data-i18n="problemTitle">Here's the uncomfortable truth</h2>
      <p class="pas-lead" data-i18n="problemLead">Most business owners run their business well - but have no idea how it actually looks to a stranger searching for them online right now.</p>
      <div class="stat-grid">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">93%</span>
          <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="stat1">of customers check reviews before choosing a business</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">3 in 4</span>
          <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="stat2">customers won't return after one unanswered complaint</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">0</span>
          <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="stat3">is how many business owners check all this weekly</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ AGITATE (A) ============ -->
  <section class="pas-section agitate">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2 data-i18n="agitateTitle">And every day you don't know, it's costing you</h2>
      <div class="agitate-grid">
        <div class="agitate-item">
          <span class="agitate-icon">🔍</span>
          <p data-i18n="agitate1">A competitor with a weaker product but a stronger Google profile is ranking above you right now.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="agitate-item">
